# SoundPlant demo: ambient, 64 BPM, F lydian. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# Slow water in F Lydian. A glass-bell motif (C A B F: the B natural is the Lydian colour) is stated, inverted, halved,
# reharmonized over Am9 and Dm9, and doubled an octave up. A koto arpeggio carries the middle like water. The clearing
# plays the same motif over Dbmaj7 and Ebadd9 (the borrowed bVI and bVII, a chromatic mediant lift) and lands home on F.
# T1 kit (heartbeat, no backbeat)  T2 knit round sub  T3 bellows rotor pad  T4 rayon glass bell (the motif)
# T5 cane koto (the water)  T6 voile whisper drone  T7 rayon glass pad swells  T8 voile soprano air
# Song: mist 4, dew 4, stream 4, stream 2 4, current 8, hush 4, clearing 4, lift 4, homecoming 8, ember 4.
bpm 64
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 5
knob 9 e3 4

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a heartbeat, a ghost, a brushed shaker; never a backbeat
knob 1 d1.k1 70
knob 1 d1.k2 62
knob 1 d1.k3 44
knob 1 d1.k4 48
knob 1 d1.volume 84
knob 1 d9.volume 44
knob 1 d9.send1 18
knob 1 d6.volume 44
knob 1 level 88
# T2 a knit round sub: the slow bass
preset 2 round_sub knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 level 56
# T3 a bellows rotor pad: three-note voicings that move by step
preset 3 rotor_pad bellows
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 level 80
knob 3 pan 64
knob 3 send2 50
# T4 a rayon glass bell: the motif
preset 4 glass_bell rayon
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 level 108
knob 4 pan 56
knob 4 send1 24
knob 4 send2 48
# T5 a cane koto: the water
preset 5 koto cane
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 level 127
knob 5 pan 78
knob 5 send1 30
knob 5 send2 40
# T6 a voile whisper pad: the drone
preset 6 whisper_pad voile
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 r 66
knob 6 level 76
knob 6 pan 30
knob 6 send2 60
# T7 a rayon glass pad: slow swells
preset 7 glass_pad rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 r 70
knob 7 level 84
knob 7 pan 100
knob 7 send2 60
# T8 a voile soprano: air
preset 8 soprano voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 r 72
knob 8 level 80
knob 8 pan 42
knob 8 send2 60
# FX I a slow echo, FX II a big hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 46
knob 11 e4 44
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 92
knob 12 e3 62
mst lo 60
mst hi 46
mst comp 38
mst pump 0
mst release 74
mst level 104

